      "versionNonce": 1234468490,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784909973386,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. after we have found the middle\nelement split the list in left\nand right by doing slow.next = nul\n\nmy doubt as we are doint slow.next as null \n, we are not modifying the orginal list\nbecause slow.next is holding a different \nlinked list i think and this what happens",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. after we have found the middle\nelement split the list in left\nand right by doing slow.next = nul\n\nmy doubt as we are doint slow.next as null \n, we are not modifying the orginal list\nbecause slow.next is holding a different \nlinked list i think and this what happens",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
